~ start
if not StoryFlags.met_clown
	=> first_dialogue
else
	=> nothing_to_say

~ first_dialogue
???: HELLO LITTLE BOY
Roadie: Whoa!-
Clown: Can I make you a balloon animal? Ice cream cone? Clown nose?
Roadie: How old do I look?
Clown: You couldn't be a day over 5!
Roadie: I'm 23...
Clown: I count age in addition kid, it's so much fun!
Roadie: I'm also the detective on this murder case
Clown: OOOH YEAAA! That's why they locked me in here!
Clown: *I thought we had the fun police raiding the joint*
: The clown honks his nose
Clown: Hehehe! I thought you were making pizzas in the kitchen. Pulling a double shift??
Roadie: It's a... recent development
Roadie: The detective is in a-
Roadie: dire digestional disagreement.
: The clown looks left, then looks right, then speaks past the back of his hand
Clown: I see~
Roadie: I'll be back to ask some questions, so don't go anywhere
Clown: I'll get comfortable right here detective!
: The clown stands straight up and makes a mocking salute
Roadie: How many weirdoes slipped in tonight?
$> StoryFlags.met_clown = true
=> END

~ nothing_to_say
Clown: I made a ballon animal model of the suspect!
: The clown has made a ballon animal giraffe wearing a black theif's mask
Clown: Between you and me I really think he did it
Roadie: Thanks for the help.. I'll come back when I have a question for you.
=> END